      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing the Functionality**\n\nI've crafted `fetch_document.py`, which includes the core functionality. I utilized `boto3` for AWS DynamoDB interaction, thus improving the identification of the provider. I've defined `fetch_document_by_id`, which takes table name and document ID, and attempts a retrieval.\n\n\n**Refining the Implementation**\n\nI've got the initial structure of `fetch_document.py` in place, complete with the `fetch_document_by_id` function. I'm focusing on exception handling now, particularly for cases where the document is not found or when there are connectivity issues with DynamoDB. I'm considering best practices to improve readability and logging.\n\n\n",
